# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the real values.
# `.env.local` is git-ignored - never commit real keys.

# --- Contact form email delivery (Resend) ---------------------------------
# 1. Sign up free at https://resend.com with Rafik.alhalabi.1994@gmail.com
# 2. Create a key at https://resend.com/api-keys
# 3. Paste it below, then restart `npm run dev`
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Where enquiries land. Defaults to `contact.email` in src/lib/site.ts.
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=Rafik.alhalabi.1994@gmail.com

# Who they appear to come from.
# Resend's shared sender below needs no domain, but can ONLY deliver to the
# address that owns the Resend account. Once nexaconnect's own domain is
# verified at https://resend.com/domains, switch this to something like
# "Nexa Connect <enquiries@nexaconnect.ae>" so it can mail anyone.
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=Nexa Connect <onboarding@resend.dev>
